  <main>

    <!-- RECOMMENDATION -->
    <section id="recommendation" class="wrap">
      <p class="sec-eyebrow">The recommendation</p>
      <h2>A closed-loop portfolio, not a flat menu of offers</h2>

      <div class="thesis">
        <p>Rather than positioning Adobe Brand Visibility Success Accelerators as a flat set of independent offers, the portfolio should be organised around the <strong>closed loop customers need to operationalise to win in AI discovery</strong>.</p>
        <p>Three accelerators map directly to that loop: an <strong>early-stage accelerator</strong> to define goals, prompts, topics, competitors, baselines, and first opportunities; a <strong>middle-stage accelerator</strong> to translate those insights into content, technical, and experience actions; and a <strong>final-stage accelerator</strong> to measure progress, prove value, and establish an ongoing optimisation rhythm.</p>
        <p>Two additional accelerators extend that core model: <strong>Operating Model &amp; Governance for AI Discovery</strong>, which creates durable ownership across teams, and <strong>Priority Topic Deep-Dive Sprint</strong>, which applies the full closed loop end-to-end for one or two high-priority topics.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="collapse">
        <div class="from">
          <span class="collapse-label">Five accelerators in one portfolio</span>
          <div class="ghost-cloud">
            <span class="ghost-chip">AI Discovery Baseline &amp; Opportunity Mapping</span>
            <span class="ghost-chip">Content, Experience &amp; Technical Activation</span>
            <span class="ghost-chip">Measurement, Impact &amp; Optimisation Cadence</span>
            <span class="ghost-chip">Operating Model &amp; Governance for AI Discovery</span>
            <span class="ghost-chip">Priority Topic Deep-Dive Sprint</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="collapse-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</div>

        <div class="to">
          <span class="collapse-label">Structured as 3 + 1 + 1</span>
          <div class="solid-stack">
            <span class="solid-chip"><b>3</b> Closed-loop accelerators</span>
            <span class="solid-chip"><b>1</b> Governance accelerator</span>
            <span class="solid-chip"><b>1</b> Vertical deep-dive accelerator</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ACCELERATORS -->
    <section id="accelerators" class="band">
      <div class="band-inner">
        <p class="sec-eyebrow">The five accelerators</p>
        <h2>From baseline to action, measurement, governance, and focused deep dives</h2>
        <p class="intro">Each accelerator is a short, outcome-driven engagement with a clear role in the customer journey. Three accelerators align to the closed loop of AI discovery, one establishes the operating model needed to sustain it, and one applies the full loop deeply to a small number of strategic topics.</p>

        <div class="journey">

          <!-- 01 -->
          <div class="stage">
            <div class="stage-num">01</div>
            <div class="panel">
              <div class="meta-row">
                <span class="chip-pri must">Core</span>
                <span class="chip-stage">Closed loop &middot; <b>Early stage</b></span>
              </div>
              <h3>AI Discovery Baseline &amp; Opportunity Mapping</h3>
              <p class="goal"><b>Primary outcome</b> &middot; Define where to compete, what to measure, and what to prioritise first.</p>
              <p class="bestfor"><b>Best for</b> &middot; Every new customer</p>

              <div class="cols3">
                <div>
                  <h4>What it covers</h4>
                  <ul class="ticks">
                    <li>Define the customer&rsquo;s AI discovery goals and success criteria</li>
                    <li>Build the prompt strategy across branded, category, comparison, and high-intent prompts</li>
                    <li>Identify topic clusters and the competitor set</li>
                    <li>Establish the initial baseline and prioritise first opportunities</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4>Sample activities</h4>
                  <ul class="dash">
                    <li>Goals and AI-discovery alignment workshop</li>
                    <li>Prompt and topic mapping session</li>
                    <li>Competitor benchmarking setup</li>
                    <li>Baseline review and first-backlog prioritisation</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4>Deliverables</h4>
                  <ul class="checks">
                    <li>Prompt strategy framework</li>
                    <li>Topic and competitor map</li>
                    <li>Baseline measurement scorecard</li>
                    <li>Prioritised optimisation backlog</li>
                    <li>30 / 60 / 90-day action plan</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="value"><b>Customer value</b> &mdash; Faster time to value, better early alignment, and a clear starting point for where Adobe Brand Visibility can create impact.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 02 -->
          <div class="stage">
            <div class="stage-num">02</div>
            <div class="panel">
              <div class="meta-row">
                <span class="chip-pri must">Core</span>
                <span class="chip-stage">Closed loop &middot; <b>Middle stage</b></span>
              </div>
              <h3>Content, Experience &amp; Technical Activation</h3>
              <p class="goal"><b>Primary outcome</b> &middot; Turn identified opportunities into prioritised content and technical action.</p>
              <p class="bestfor"><b>Best for</b> &middot; Customers with web, SEO, and content teams</p>

              <div class="cols3">
                <div>
                  <h4>What it covers</h4>
                  <ul class="ticks">
                    <li>Review content and page types most relevant to AI discovery</li>
                    <li>Identify crawlability, accessibility, and structure issues affecting AI agents</li>
                    <li>Evaluate summaries, FAQs, schema, and page-readiness signals</li>
                    <li>Prioritise content, technical, and on-site experience improvements</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4>Sample activities</h4>
                  <ul class="dash">
                    <li>Current-state content and page review</li>
                    <li>AI-agent readiness assessment</li>
                    <li>Opportunity review using product insights</li>
                    <li>Prioritisation workshop with web, SEO, and content teams</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4>Deliverables</h4>
                  <ul class="checks">
                    <li>Content and technical readiness assessment</li>
                    <li>Prioritised recommendations by page type</li>
                    <li>Optimisation brief for content and web teams</li>
                    <li>Implementation roadmap or sprint plan</li>
                    <li>Risk and dependency summary</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="value"><b>Customer value</b> &mdash; A clearer path from insight to action, stronger cross-team prioritisation, and faster movement on the changes most likely to improve AI visibility.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 03 -->
          <div class="stage">
            <div class="stage-num">03</div>
            <div class="panel">
              <div class="meta-row">
                <span class="chip-pri must">Core</span>
                <span class="chip-stage">Closed loop &middot; <b>Final stage</b></span>
              </div>
              <h3>Measurement, Impact &amp; Optimisation Cadence</h3>
              <p class="goal"><b>Primary outcome</b> &middot; Measure progress, prove value, and establish a repeatable optimisation rhythm.</p>
              <p class="bestfor"><b>Best for</b> &middot; Customers that need ROI visibility and an executive narrative</p>

              <div class="cols3">
                <div>
                  <h4>What it covers</h4>
                  <ul class="ticks">
                    <li>Define the KPI framework across visibility, traffic, engagement, and impact</li>
                    <li>Separate leading indicators from business-outcome indicators</li>
                    <li>Build an executive-ready scorecard and business narrative</li>
                    <li>Establish a recurring optimisation and reporting cadence</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4>Sample activities</h4>
                  <ul class="dash">
                    <li>KPI alignment workshop</li>
                    <li>Current reporting and dashboard review</li>
                    <li>Scorecard design session</li>
                    <li>Optimisation cadence and QBR-readout planning</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4>Deliverables</h4>
                  <ul class="checks">
                    <li>Executive scorecard template</li>
                    <li>KPI framework and glossary</li>
                    <li>Reporting cadence and ownership model</li>
                    <li>Optimisation review framework</li>
                    <li>QBR-ready business impact narrative</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="value"><b>Customer value</b> &mdash; Stronger executive alignment, clearer proof of progress, and a repeatable rhythm for turning insight into ongoing improvement.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 04 -->
          <div class="stage">
            <div class="stage-num">04</div>
            <div class="panel">
              <div class="meta-row">
                <span class="chip-pri high">Cross-functional</span>
                <span class="chip-stage">Portfolio enabler &middot; <b>Horizontal</b></span>
              </div>
              <h3>Operating Model &amp; Governance for AI Discovery</h3>
              <p class="goal"><b>Primary outcome</b> &middot; Create durable ownership across SEO, content, PR / comms, analytics, and web.</p>
              <p class="bestfor"><b>Best for</b> &middot; Enterprise / global customers</p>

              <div class="cols3">
                <div>
                  <h4>What it covers</h4>
                  <ul class="ticks">
                    <li>Define ownership across the functions involved in AI discovery</li>
                    <li>Clarify who manages prompts, content, reporting, escalation, and approvals</li>
                    <li>Establish governance for optimisation reviews and decision-making</li>
                    <li>Support enterprise-scale alignment across brands, business units, or regions</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4>Sample activities</h4>
                  <ul class="dash">
                    <li>Cross-functional stakeholder workshop</li>
                    <li>Current-state ownership and workflow review</li>
                    <li>RACI development session</li>
                    <li>Governance cadence and operating model design</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4>Deliverables</h4>
                  <ul class="checks">
                    <li>Cross-functional RACI</li>
                    <li>Governance framework</li>
                    <li>Review cadence and meeting structure</li>
                    <li>Escalation and approval model</li>
                    <li>Recommended operating model</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="value"><b>Customer value</b> &mdash; Less ambiguity, faster decisions, and stronger consistency across the teams responsible for AI discovery outcomes.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 05 -->
          <div class="stage">
            <div class="stage-num">05</div>
            <div class="panel">
              <div class="meta-row">
                <span class="chip-pri high">Focused deep dive</span>
                <span class="chip-stage">Portfolio extension &middot; <b>Vertical</b></span>
              </div>
              <h3>Priority Topic Deep-Dive Sprint</h3>
              <p class="goal"><b>Primary outcome</b> &middot; Apply the full closed loop end-to-end for one or two strategic topics.</p>
              <p class="bestfor"><b>Best for</b> &middot; Customers that want a focused proof point or a repeatable blueprint</p>

              <div class="cols3">
                <div>
                  <h4>What it covers</h4>
                  <ul class="ticks">
                    <li>Select one or two priority topics, categories, or strategic use cases</li>
                    <li>Establish a topic-specific baseline across prompts, visibility, and competitors</li>
                    <li>Assess content, technical, and experience gaps for those topics</li>
                    <li>Prioritise actions and track progress through to a readout</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4>Sample activities</h4>
                  <ul class="dash">
                    <li>Topic selection and success-criteria workshop</li>
                    <li>Prompt and baseline analysis for selected topics</li>
                    <li>Targeted content and technical diagnosis</li>
                    <li>Readout of outcomes, lessons, and scale recommendations</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4>Deliverables</h4>
                  <ul class="checks">
                    <li>Topic-specific baseline and opportunity assessment</li>
                    <li>Prioritised optimisation action plan</li>
                    <li>Ownership tracker for agreed actions</li>
                    <li>Performance readout for selected topics</li>
                    <li>Scale-out recommendations for adjacent topics</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="value"><b>Customer value</b> &mdash; A focused way to prove value quickly, build stakeholder confidence, and create a repeatable blueprint for broader rollout.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- AT A GLANCE -->
    <section id="glance" class="wrap">
      <p class="sec-eyebrow">At a glance</p>
      <h2>The portfolio in one view</h2>

      <div class="table-scroll">
