            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><span class="tnum">3</span>Measurement, Impact &amp; Optimisation Cadence</td>
              <td>Core closed-loop</td>
              <td>Customers asking for ROI and ongoing proof</td>
              <td>Measure progress and establish recurring optimisation</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><span class="tnum">4</span>Operating Model &amp; Governance for AI Discovery</td>
              <td>Horizontal enabler</td>
              <td>Enterprise / global customers</td>
              <td>Create durable ownership across teams</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><span class="tnum">5</span>Priority Topic Deep-Dive Sprint</td>
              <td>Vertical deep dive</td>
              <td>Customers with 1&ndash;2 priority topics</td>
              <td>Apply the full closed loop end-to-end on a narrow strategic area</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- WHY -->
    <section id="why" class="band">
      <div class="band-inner">
        <p class="sec-eyebrow">Rationale</p>
        <h2>Why this structure works</h2>

        <div class="why-grid">
          <div class="why-card">
            <span class="tag">Closed loop</span>
            <h4>It mirrors how customers actually work</h4>
            <p>The portfolio follows the real lifecycle of AI discovery: establish the baseline, activate improvements, and measure impact through ongoing optimisation.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="why-card">
            <span class="tag">Governance</span>
            <h4>It makes ownership explicit</h4>
            <p>Operating Model &amp; Governance is treated as a cross-functional enabler, not forced into a stage model where it only partially fits.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="why-card">
            <span class="tag">Adoption</span>
            <h4>It adds a focused proof-point motion</h4>
            <p>The Priority Topic Deep-Dive Sprint gives customers a practical way to run the full model on a narrow scope, prove value, and scale from a real example.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- MESSAGING -->
    <section id="messaging" class="wrap">
      <p class="sec-eyebrow">How to say it</p>
      <h2>Recommended messaging</h2>

      <blockquote>
        <p>We recommend a <strong>closed-loop portfolio of five Success Accelerators</strong> for Adobe Brand Visibility. Three accelerators align to the early, middle, and final stages of AI discovery: establishing the baseline, activating content and technical improvements, and measuring impact through an ongoing optimisation cadence. Two additional accelerators extend that core model: one creates the operating model and governance needed for cross-functional execution, and one applies the full closed loop end-to-end to one or two high-priority topics.</p>
      </blockquote>
    </section>

